command: string
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
> string
Nails are set into the ground every ten meters, north and south and east and
west (and in some cases up and down). A grid of strings between them divides the
whole site into squares.

[0m[4mAfter you examine something, the bar at the bottom of the screen will suggest
some actions you might do with it.
