command: metal post
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
> metal post
This metal post marks the datum: the origin of the archaeologists’ coordinate
system. It’s anchored very securely into the ground—if it moved even a few
centimeters, after all, every single measurement would need to be redone.

[0m[4mIf this interface isn’t working for you, you can adjust it in the [0m[4m[50m<OPTIONS>[0m[4m.
