something like that...you have all the right paperwork, you’re officially a
guest of the archaeologists, and besides, it’s not like you’re going to be 
[0m[4mtaking[0m anything. It’s just so much easier to do these things in the early hours
of the morning, when you don’t have to explain what a forensic necromancer is,
or why you need silence to meditate over the bones.

