id: 1778630448673
parent-id: 1778630448672
command: divine them
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
> divine them
This is it. You sit down and get as comfortable as you can, making sure the
bones are clearly in your field of view. The mirror goes in front of your left
eye, adjusted until the images overlap: one eye seeing the bones, the other
reflected back at itself. The entheogen tablet under your tongue, where it
starts to dissolve. Now, to meditate.

The idea of a memory palace goes back to the ancient Greeks: anchoring your
memories by laying them out in an imaginary space. Forensic necromancy is the
same. You just do it for someone else’s memories instead. Drawing them from the
bones, guiding them, giving them shape. Until lines start to shine in your mind,
and colors, and...

<[] [[Continue]]>

