>  

[0m[1mZiggurat[0m
Everything is a haze. Colors muted, sounds muffled. But you can make out one
line, and then another, and another—something solid, something [0m[4mreal[0m. You try to
focus your mind on it, and a shape begins to emerge. The fog recedes in a great
rush and a ringing silence fills your ears.

<[] [[Continue]]>

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
id: 1778630448675
parent-id: 1778630448674
command:  
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
>  
You’re standing on a wide platform halfway up a tower of towers: one massive
pillar stacked on another, on another, on another. The top vanishes into the
mists above and the ground is nothing but a distant blur. You’re left on the
walkway in between, canted at a steeper angle than is really comfortable.

All around, other memories have forced their way in like tree roots cracking
through a sidewalk. To the south, the walkway runs headlong into the front of a
mud-brick house, its <door> firmly barred from the other side; west, the steps
down barely make it a meter before they’re lost in a <blinding light>.

The whole tableau is frozen like a fly in amber. The dust swirls around your
feet with every step, but the moment you’re past, it hangs motionless in the
air. The only flicker of movement is along the walkway to the northwest.

[0m[4m(Your <score> has gone up by one point.)
