id: 1778640300991
parent-id: 1778712896270
command: divine them
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
> divine them
You have to try a couple positions before you find one that works: you need a
clear view of the bones, but if you’re too vertical, you might fall over when
the visions set in. Eventually you settle down on the wall between the grid
squares and pull out your mirror and tablets.

This one is easier than the first. You already have some memories from the same
time and place; you hold your focus on those, using them as an anchor for the
new visions. Soon the outlines start to take form...

