[0m[1mCramped passage[0m
While the jumble of room-fragments to the west feels larger than any building
could be, this one feels tight and confined, no matter how big the fragments
are. Pieces of memory fit together at odd angles and thick, sticky darkness
coats every surface, flowing back into place as soon as your lamp moves past.
Off to the northeast, though, you can make out a flicker of movement.

