command: n
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
> n
You move toward the traces of motion, and the dream shifts...

[0m[4m“The construction is almost finished, Your Majesty.” You keep your nose pressed
to the floor as you hear the king move; he’s not the sort to tolerate
insubordination. “We thank you again for your generosity. We greatly appreciate
it—and so does Marduk. Once the temple is fully rebuilt, he is certain to bless
your reign.”

“Certain?” The king’s voice is sharp and accusing, and you try not to wince.
“How can you be certain when it comes to the gods?”

Better play it safe. “How could anyone, divine or mortal, not appreciate such a
gift as Your Majesty has given? How could anyone in Babylon doubt your kingship
after the wisdom and kindness you have shown? The four corners of the world bow
to you, Your Majesty, as well they should.”

He sniffs and turns away, and you relax just a fraction. “Very well. Finish the
construction. I want to see the cult statue placed before the end of the year. I
need Marduk’s blessing as soon as possible. [0mNeed[0m[4m it. Do you understand? And
also, I need a full review of the temple staff. My mother’s diviners say there
are traitors there, and I need to root them out. Purging...let’s say two thirds
of the staff should do it.”

“Two thirds?!” You sit up sharply before you can stop yourself. “Your Majesty!
The Temple of Marduk is loyal to you! We need—”

Suddenly the king is very, very close to you, his eyes blazing with fury. “Is it
you, then? You’re the one she warned me about? It must be. It has to be. Yes.
That’s why—that’s why it—”

“Your Majesty! Please! My loyalty has never been in question! I orchestrated
that ‘conspiracy’ for you; without me, you wouldn’t—”

It was the wrong thing to say. In a split second the king’s hands are on your
throat, with far more strength than you would have expected from his frail body.
“I. Need. [0mNo one[0m[4m. I can trust. [0mNo one[0m[4m. It was you...it was you, all along! And
once I’m rid of you...then, then, that’s when I’ll finally be safe!”
[0m
